# Single source of truth:
#   EFI binary:    efi-unlock/50HXUNLK.EFI
#   BYOVD drivers: efi-unlock-windows/gen2/drivers/ThrottleStop.sys
#                  efi-unlock-windows/gen2/drivers/WinRing0x64.sys
# tools/build-windows.ps1 (local) and .github/workflows/release.yml (CI)
# copy all three into this directory before the Go build so //go:embed
# picks them up. Tracking them here would let the binaries drift from the
# C source / repo again (last happened with v1.1.1/v1.1.2/v1.1.3 — Windows
# release shipped a pre-fix EFI while Linux shipped the post-fix one).
50HXUNLK.EFI
ThrottleStop.sys
WinRing0x64.sys